// @description LWS-7
// @version 1.0
// @author Lo-lo / OpenAI
// @changelog
//   Initial ReaPack package version (DSP and settings unchanged).

desc:LWS-7 
// Wind factory + tuning update: Recorder +1 octave; Fine Tune = +/-12.00 semitones at 0.01-step (2026-08-20)
// Sustain update: Organ, Strings and Micro Synth now support MIDI CC64; fixed -2 dB post-engine trim before shared Delay/Reverb (2026-09-06).
// Playability update: Rhodes/Wurlitzer reuse the active voice of a repeated MIDI note, including under CC64, so repeated chords do not stack duplicate pitches and exhaust polyphony (2026-09-06).
// CPU TEST: Global Cold Sleep — after 2048 samples of true silence with no engine/effect tail, the complete @sample DSP path sleeps until MIDI/audio work returns (2026-09-15).
//tags: instrument synthesis experimental stepsine
//author: Lo-lo / OpenAI

